---
const syncItems = ['Verfügbarkeiten', 'Preise', 'Restriktionen', 'Reservierungen'];
---

<section id="channel-manager" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-secondary-950 py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="absolute -left-24 top-0 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-primary-500/20 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="absolute -right-24 bottom-0 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-success-500/15 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="section-container relative">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-primary-400/30 bg-primary-500/15 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary-200">
          Channel Manager für Booking.com & Co.
        </p>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-3xl font-bold text-white md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
          Booking.com anbinden. Direktbuchungen behalten.
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-7 text-lg leading-relaxed text-secondary-300">
          Verbinden Sie Booking.com und weitere Buchungsportale direkt mit Zimmero. Alles wird automatisch in beide Richtungen synchronisiert. Gleichzeitig gewinnen Sie mit Ihrer eigenen Hotelwebsite gezielt mehr gebührenfreie Direktbuchungen.
        </p>

        <div class="mb-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4">
          {syncItems.map(item => (
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-secondary-200">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-success-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
              {item}
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <a
          href="/channel-manager-booking-com/"
          class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white px-7 py-3.5 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-secondary-950 shadow-lg transition-colors hover:bg-primary-50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-white/20 sm:w-auto"
        >
          Channel Manager im Detail
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-secondary-400">
          Keine komplizierten Pakete. Keine Prozentprovision an Zimmero.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/10 p-6 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm">
            <p class="mb-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary-400">OTA-Buchung</p>
            <p class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Booking.com & Co.</p>
            <div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2">
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-300">nur</span>
              <span class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">1,50 €</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-secondary-300">/ Buchung</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-secondary-400">
              Nur für Buchungen, die über ein angebundenes Portal eingehen.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="relative rounded-2xl border-2 border-success-300 bg-success-50 p-6 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(34,197,94,0.25)] sm:-translate-y-3">
            <p class="absolute right-4 top-4 rounded-full bg-success-500 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">Bester Preis</p>
            <p class="mb-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-success-700">Direktbuchung</p>
            <p class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900">Eigene Hotelwebsite</p>
            <div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2">
              <span class="text-5xl font-bold text-success-600">0 €</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-success-700">/ Buchung</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-success-800">
              0 % Provision. Direkt gebucht heißt: kein Cent pro Buchung an Zimmero.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-secondary-900/80 px-5 py-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-secondary-300">
          <strong class="text-white">Volle Synchronisation, klare Kosten:</strong> Für OTA-Buchungen zahlen Sie lediglich 1,50 € pro Buchung. Zum gewählten Zimmero-Tarif kommt keine zusätzliche monatliche Channel-Manager-Grundgebühr.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
